<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Dec 13.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
